CounterStrikeExtended licensing scope
====================================

This repository is not licensed as a whole under MIT.

The MIT text in LICENSES/MIT.txt applies only to copyrightable original
contributions authored for this fork, to the extent their authors have the
necessary rights. For the initial development work, that scope is the original
build orchestration in CMakeLists.txt, CMakePresets.json, cmake/MSVCDefaults.cmake,
cmake/RuntimeTargets.cmake, hardware/CMakeLists.txt, tools/translate_msbuild.py,
tools/export-msbuild.ps1, .gitignore, and original prose in this fork's new docs
and rewritten README.md. It does not cover quoted or copied third-party content.

Inherited source and modifications to it under GoldSrc-SDK/, bundled libraries,
headers, artwork, provider interfaces, upstream-manifests.zip, and generated
MSBuild selection data retain their existing notices, restrictions and unresolved
provenance. The generated cmake/targets/ files contain inherited source/flag/export
selections: the license of the original generator does not grant new rights to
the selected code or claim these inherited selections are wholly MIT.

No blanket MIT grant, commercial redistribution permission, or ownership of Valve,
Id, Steamworks, Miles, Aureal or other inherited content is asserted. See
docs/licensing.md for component evidence, retained notices and unresolved rights.
